  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demographic Data Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Demographic Data component focuses on generating, analyzing, interpreting, and visualizing population data for decision making on demography. UNFPA supports the National Institute of Statistics and the Ministry of Economy and Finance to produce data including for the Demographic Health Survey, the 2022 Household Survey and making use of the 2017 Census information in routine sectoral data.</narrative>
  </description>
